  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida HFA V PBA proposal Year 4</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with the country SAP, in the coming Sida period, IRC South Sudan will address the major
humanitarian needs related to safety and food security, as well as gaps in health, nutrition, and protection services, where there are escalating needs compared to recent years. We work to provide humanitarian support to address the multifaceted challenges faced by communities affected by conflict, climate change and climate induced disasters. As well as working across all humanitarian sectors, our key strategic priorities include enhancing safety in communities, improving child health and nutrition, ensuring access to sexual and reproductive health (SRH) services and promoting environmental health.</narrative>
  </description>
